        <item>
            <title>0.1.40</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:49:46 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/OldSixYao/EasyMarkdown</link>
            <sparkle:version>41</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.40</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>只读模式下在文档正文按回车或数字键盘回车时，也显示是否开始编辑的确认框；确定后进入源码编辑，取消继续阅读，触发提示的回车不写入换行。</li><li>保留查找框、复制按钮和确认框的回车操作，增加两种回车、取消后长按去重及回车确认进入编辑的真实窗口检查。</li></ul>]]></description>
